/E (The final outputs included: three basic 2D profiles and an independent Mounting Bracket sketch \(Assignment 1\); a Symmetrical Mounting Bracket and a thin-walled Phone Stand with Shell, Fillet, and Draft features \(Assignment 2\); and a fully constrained Belt Support assembly along with its production-ready engineering drawing \(Assignment 3\). )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
366 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 180 0 R
/E (Before exporting each part, sketch, and assembly, the FeatureManager Design Tree was checked for rebuild errors and warnings \(red/yellow flags\), and each sketch was verified to be Fully Defined \(all sketch entities shown in black rather than blue\). For the Belt Support assembly, one configuration was verified to have zero degrees of freedom \(fully mated\), while a second configuration was kept movable to demonstrate correct mate behaviour. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [3]
>>
